- leave the bottom-left attribution reservation unobstructed (same region as the content exclusion zone)
{% elif watermark.enabled and watermark.position == "bottom_center" %}
- leave the bottom-center attribution reservation unobstructed
{% elif watermark.enabled and watermark.position == "top_right" %}
