## Visual Direction

- Mood: {{ theme.mood }}
- Style: {{ theme.style }}
- Color mode: {{ theme.color_mode }}
- Background: {{ theme.background_color }}
- Primary color: {{ theme.primary_color }}
- Accent color: {{ theme.accent_color }}
- Text color: {{ theme.text_color }}
- Chart color: {{ theme.chart_color }}

Create a premium indie-founder / technology aesthetic.

The result should feel:

- confident
- modern
- clean
- technical
- premium
- understated
- polished
- suitable for a build-in-public founder account

Keep the overall banner predominantly dark.

### Background

Use:

- deep charcoal or near-black base
- subtle technical square grid
- restrained soft gradients
- faint diagonal illumination
- very subtle colored glow
- generous negative space

### Decorative Language

Use restrained geometric decorations such as:

- extremely thin flowing curves
- partial geometric circles or arcs entering from canvas edges
- sparse dotted patterns
- subtle angular outlines
- soft gradient waves
- very faint technical grid elements

Decorations should primarily occupy:

- corners
- outer edges
- unused transitions between content regions

Do not place prominent decorative geometry directly behind important text.

Do not let decorative elements compete with the headline, app information, status card, or progress bar.

### Lighting

Use subtle asymmetric lighting.

Possible treatments include:

- restrained cool or green glow near the left edge
- subtle illumination through the center
- complementary accent glow near the opposite edge
- soft gradients fading naturally into black

Maintain deep blacks throughout most of the canvas.

Avoid excessive bloom.

## Typography

Use crisp modern sans-serif typography.

The headline may use a bold condensed or semi-condensed display font.

Use strong contrast between text and background.

Preferred hierarchy:

- headline: bold white with selected important value or target highlighted using the primary/accent treatment
- top label: uppercase accent color with modest letter spacing
- subtitle: white or slightly muted white
- app names: bold white
- app values: white
- important MRR figures: accent color
- secondary numbers: muted white or gray

Do not use excessive font styles.

Do not use decorative script fonts.

Do not use tiny unreadable text.

